{"id":"85735","name":"果香鲜辣椒酱","author":"大吃包","authorId":"15265","desc":"","cover":"images/85735/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"10个"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"一头半"},{"name":"鲜姜一两","amount":"一两"},{"name":"糖","amount":"两大勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"两小勺"},{"name":"味精","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"高度白酒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"辣椒去籽儿，去蒂，洗净控干","img":"images/85735/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入绞菜机器里，把辣椒绞成碎末。","img":"images/85735/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鲜姜去皮。","img":"images/85735/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切成厚片。","img":"images/85735/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"沙果和香水梨去除果核","img":"images/85735/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用大蒜剥皮器去除蒜的表皮。","img":"images/85735/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把大蒜和鲜姜分别放入机器里绞碎。","img":"images/85735/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把准备好的盐，味精糖拌入辣椒末里。","img":"images/85735/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：搅拌机\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}